{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261110/photo/bkn-20261110195831208-1110_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261110215255\"/><p>今晚(10日)第119期六合彩攪珠結果：3、11、13、15、17、24，特別號碼為19。頭獎無人中；二獎6注中，每注派彩284,660港元；三獎118.5注中，每注派彩38,430港元。</p><p>下期六合彩攪珠將於周四(11月12日)舉行，估計頭獎基金可達20,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:01:47.046917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:58:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:54:58.722155+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:54:58.722155+00:00","content_hash":"e0a9051c4216c8668d87606c95af377d048d07d83d6b893a84e1b8973244c70a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}